      lost: ['PAPER LANTERN', 'WOODBLOCK', 'FAN', 'GETA SANDAL', 'SOBA BOWL'],
      folk: [
        "Edo is one of the biggest cities in the world. A million people, they say, and all of them hungry.",
        "The houses are wood and paper, so the firemen are heroes. They wave a great standard on the rooftops.",
        "Woodblock prints: one block for each colour. The carver, the printer and the artist all sign it.",
        "Kabuki lasts all day. Bring lunch. Shout the actor's name at the big moment. That's polite.",
        "Sumo wrestlers stamp to chase away bad luck before the bout. And to look very big.",
        "The soba man comes round with a bowl of noodles and a little stove on a pole.",
        "Evenings, everyone goes to the public bath. That's where all the news is.",
        "In spring the whole city goes out under the cherry blossom with picnics. Even the grumpy ones.",
      ],
      signs: { home: ['Beware of fire.', 'Bathhouse open.'], town2: ['Kabuki today!', 'Soba: hot.'], town3: ['Sumo: spring tournament.', 'Prints sold here.'] },
