      lost: ['MANUSCRIPT', 'SALT SLAB', 'QUILL', 'GOLD DUST', 'ASTROLABE'],
      folk: [
        "Salt comes from the north on camels, gold from the south by river. They meet here.",
        "Families here have kept books for hundreds of years: maths, medicine, the stars, the law.",
        "Copying a book by hand takes months. That's why a good book costs more than a camel.",
        "The mosques are built of mud brick. Every year after the rains, the whole town replasters them.",
        "Those wooden poles sticking out of the walls? Scaffolding that stays forever, for the replastering.",
        "The griot remembers the history of every family, and sings it. He's a library with a voice.",
        "An emperor from here went on pilgrimage with so much gold, he changed the price of it on his way.",
        "Scholars came from everywhere to study here. You'd hear six languages in one street.",
      ],
      signs: { home: ['Manuscripts: handle gently.', 'Caravans ->'], town2: ['Salt traded for gold.', 'Replastering festival!'], town3: ['Astronomer\'s roof.', 'Water at the well.'] },
