      lost: ['ACID SUIT', 'AIR TANK', 'DRONE REMOTE', 'SEED TRAY', 'BALLOON PATCH'],
      folk: [
        "Down on the surface it's hot enough to melt lead. Up here, about fifty kilometres high, it's quite pleasant.",
        "Our breathable air is lighter than Venus's air. So our whole city is a balloon full of air. Clever, eh?",
        "The clouds are made of sulphuric acid. Wear your suit outside. Always. Even for a minute.",
        "A day on Venus is longer than its year. It spins that slowly. Birthdays come before bedtime.",
        "Venus spins backwards. If you could see the sun, it would rise in the west.",
        "The winds up here whizz round the whole planet in about four days. We just float along.",
        "We grow crops in the gondola under lamps. Lettuce, beans, strawberries. Sky strawberries!",
        "From Earth, Venus is the morning star. From here, Earth is the blue dot we wave to.",
      ],
